  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "4d282943-c4a3-4ee5-8b82-9bf4fc116ac7",
    "name": "AISafe - auth-service (SIDIS A1)",
    "description": "auth-service (2 replicas: 8051, 8052).\n\n1. Generate the certificates and start both replicas.\n2. Postman > Settings > General: turn OFF 'SSL certificate verification' (self-signed certificate).\n3. Run folders 0-3 (folder 1 saves the tokens in the collection variables).\n4. Folder 4 blocks the user lockout-demo for 5 minutes: run it last.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
